{"title":"Environment Variables","content":"> Most of these environment variables only pertain to those contributing to Fluster directly. These variables will have no effect for those building plugins or simply using Fluster.\n\n| Env Var | What it does | Default |\n| ------- | ------------ | ------- |\n| `FLUSTER_DATABASE_PORT` | Specifies the port that the embedded database server will expose itself on. | 21521 |","_meta":{"filePath":"user/env_variables.mdx","fileName":"env_variables.mdx","directory":"user","extension":"mdx","path":"user/env_variables"},"toc":[],"structuredData":{"contents":[{"heading":"","content":"Most of these environment variables only pertain to those contributing to Fluster directly. These variables will have no effect for those building plugins or simply using Fluster."},{"heading":"","content":"Env Var"},{"heading":"","content":"What it does"},{"heading":"","content":"Default"},{"heading":"","content":"FLUSTER_DATABASE_PORT"},{"heading":"","content":"Specifies the port that the embedded database server will expose itself on."},{"heading":"","content":"21521"}],"headings":[]},"body":"var Component=(()=>{var u=Object.create;var d=Object.defineProperty;var b=Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor;var f=Object.getOwnPropertyNames;var m=Object.getPrototypeOf,p=Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty;var x=(t,e)=>()=>(e||t((e={exports:{}}).exports,e),e.exports),_=(t,e)=>{for(var r in e)d(t,r,{get:e[r],enumerable:!0})},l=(t,e,r,i)=>{if(e&&typeof e==\"object\"||typeof e==\"function\")for(let o of f(e))!p.call(t,o)&&o!==r&&d(t,o,{get:()=>e[o],enumerable:!(i=b(e,o))||i.enumerable});return t};var y=(t,e,r)=>(r=t!=null?u(m(t)):{},l(e||!t||!t.__esModule?d(r,\"default\",{value:t,enumerable:!0}):r,t)),g=t=>l(d({},\"__esModule\",{value:!0}),t);var h=x((F,c)=>{c.exports=_jsx_runtime});var v={};_(v,{default:()=>a});var n=y(h());function s(t){let e={blockquote:\"blockquote\",code:\"code\",p:\"p\",table:\"table\",tbody:\"tbody\",td:\"td\",th:\"th\",thead:\"thead\",tr:\"tr\"